'''Summon Greater Harbinger of Brutality''' is a [[skill]] granted by {{il|The Yielding Mortality}}.

==Skill Functions and Interactions==
The summoned Harbinger is immortal, and will occasionally apply the ''The Yielding Mortality'' [[buff]] on the player. ''The Yielding Mortality'' lasts 8 seconds, with a cooldown of 20 seconds, and grants the following benefits:
* 50% increased Damage
* 15% Damage Reduction
* 30% increased Attack Speed
* 30% increased Movement Speed
* Bleeding Enemies you Kill Explode, dealing 10% of their maximum Life as Physical Damage

